# SnapshOT ICS Python libraries — human-edited source of truth for the
# `ics-python` tool (one venv on the pinned cpython-3.11.16 runtime).
#
# The hash-pinned lock (requirements.txt, committed) and the per-arch wheelhouse
# are regenerated with `scripts/vendor.py fetch` (or `wheels`), which runs
# pip-compile and `pip download --only-binary=:all:` inside a trixie container
# using this exact interpreter. Pin exact versions so the lock is reproducible.
#
# pydnp3 and opcua-client are deliberately NOT here: pydnp3 is sdist-only (dropped),
# opcua-client (PyQt5 GUI) is its own amd64-only tool (../opcua-client/).
